How much is it?

6
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,159
I'll transfer it to you.

7
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:36,840
No need.

8
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,000
No, no, no.

9
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,960
You don't have to join tomorrow's training.

10
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:41,919
That won't do.

11
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:42,960
I can't receive special treatment.

12
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:45,759
Alright.

13
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:46,560
Then we continue.

14
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:48,360
Continue.

15
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,199
Okay.

16
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,319
Give it a try.

17
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:57,879
Try it.

18
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,120
It feels quite cool.

19
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:08,879
It's burning.

20
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,520
Honey, property management will come by for the water bill.

21
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,120
Pay electricity and gas at the management office.

22
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:06,039
Go downstairs, turn left, go straight, then take a right.

23
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:08,840
It's the small yellow building.

24
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:13,280
Eat on time and order less takeout.

25
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,160
There are fresh steamed buns and rolls in the fridge.

26
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,360
And a few flaky pastries.

27
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,079
There are dumplings in the freezer.

28
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:23,399
And stuffed buns.

29
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,000
Take good care of yourself.

30
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,079
What's wrong? Didn't sleep well?

31
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,279
Not used to sleeping here, right?

32
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,959
Did you sleep well?

33
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,199
I did.

34
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:11,360
Could you hear me snoring?

35
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,480
You snored?

36
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:13,959
I didn't hear a thing.

37
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,399
I snored so loud, and you didn't hear it?

38
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,480
I'm a heavy sleeper.

39
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,160
I'll recommend a folk remedy to you later.

40
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,519
It cures snoring.

41
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,199
Does it work?

42
00:08:31,519 --> 00:08:31,959
It does.

43
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,000
Commissar Lu recommended it to me.

44
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,440
After using it, he said I stopped snoring.

45
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,679
One more thing.

46
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,320
Since you're staying at the unit now,

47
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,440
you can't fold your blanket like that.

48
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:51,840
You need to learn.

49
00:09:57,159 --> 00:09:58,200
Fall in! Hurry up!

50
00:10:01,159 --> 00:10:01,679
Hurry up!

51
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:14,440
Left, right, left

52
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,399
Left, right, left

53
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:20,440
One, two, three, four

54
