Prepare for a beating

61
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,919
Left, right, left

62
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,240
Left, right, left

63
00:11:19,279 --> 00:11:20,080
As a commissar,

64
00:11:21,799 --> 00:11:23,320
I can't let these kids look down on me.

65
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,360
Train the body,

66
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,759
Stay steady.

67
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:35,200
Build the muscle,

68
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,600
Ready for a tussle.

69
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:37,759
Left, right, left.

70
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:39,879
Left, right, left.

71
00:11:40,279 --> 00:11:42,240
One, two, three, four.

72
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,519
One, two, three, four.

73
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:47,840
Goodbye, sir.

74
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,200
Goodbye.

75
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,960
Train your body!

76
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,879
Stay ready!

77
00:12:09,679 --> 00:12:11,320
Build your muscles!

78
